# INVWINJA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the buttons
# Parts, Service, Loans and Used with of the item form, clicked, open the
# item's parts, service records, loans and holds, and what is used with
# it, as INV's Parts, Service and Loans tabs.  At level 1 (READER) item
# 1's form, shown by ENTER, opens its parts, none, by Parts; ESC there
# shows the item list with item 1's form over it again, in view mode,
# from which Service shows its service record, Loans, after ESC, its
# loans and holds, none, and Used with, after ESC, what is used with it,
# none.  After a log-out, at level 3, item 1's form switched to edit mode
# by CTRL+E opens its parts, and ESC comes back to it in edit mode,
# unchanged; a category typed there makes Parts say on the form's message
# line that the item is to be saved first, and the form stays; ESC, its
# question answered Yes, leaves it.  INS shows a new item, where Parts
# says the same.  Item 2 is installed in item 1 by Install in, and item
# 1's parts opened from its form show it; ENTER there shows item 2 in the
# item form over the parts, whose Parts shows item 2's parts, none; ESC
# goes back to item 1's parts with item 2's form over them, ESC closes
# that form, and ESC goes back to the item list with item 1's form.
# CTRL+D on item 1 copies it as item 4, whose form opens its parts by
# Parts; ESC there shows the copy's form again, in edit mode, and ESC on
# it, unchanged, closes it with the note of the copy on the status bar.
# An item's form in edit mode ignores F5, no key of its buttons; its
# notes alone typed over make Parts say the same as a category, and the
# form stays; ESC, its question answered Yes, leaves it.  The end by
# Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINJA.SNP is its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER ENTER
M 148 DOWN MID
M 148 UP MID
S RPARTS
K ESC
S RVIEW
M 149 DOWN MID
M 149 UP MID
S RSVC
K ESC
M 150 DOWN MID
M 150 UP MID
S RLOANS
K ESC
M 151 DOWN MID
M 151 UP MID
S RUSED
K ESC ESC ALT-F L STAB
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ENTER CTRL-E
M 148 DOWN MID
M 148 UP MID
S PARTS
K ESC
S EDIT
# the category changed by a letter
T C
M 148 DOWN MID
M 148 UP MID
S DIRTY
K ESC ENTER INS
M 148 DOWN MID
M 148 UP MID
S NEWTAB
K ESC DOWN ALT-C I
T 1
K ENTER UP ENTER
M 148 DOWN MID
M 148 UP MID
S PARTS1
K ENTER
M 148 DOWN MID
M 148 UP MID
S PARTS2
K ESC
S BACK2
K ESC ESC
S BACK1
K ESC CTRL-D
M 148 DOWN MID
M 148 UP MID
S COPYPRT
K ESC
S COPYBACK
K ESC
S COPIED
# F5 is no button's key; notes changed alone are unsaved as well
K ENTER CTRL-E F5
S NOF5
K CPGUP
T x
M 148 DOWN MID
M 148 UP MID
S MEMOTAB
K ESC ENTER ALT-F X
